---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components'
---

<Layout
  title="关于项目与作者 - Swift (Astro + Alpine.js)"
  description="了解 Swift 脚手架的设计哲学、开发规范，以及作者 Pony 的个人介绍与联系方式。"
>
  <div class="space-y-16 py-4 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <!-- ==================== HEADER BANNER ==================== -->
    <section class="text-center space-y-4 pt-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-primary/30 bg-primary/10 text-primary text-xs font-semibold">
        <Icon name="ion:information-circle-outline" class="h-4 w-4" />
        <span>About & Guidelines</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">关于项目与作者</h1>
      <p class="text-base-content/75 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        探讨极简工程规范，回归 Web 开发的高效本质。这里包含 Swift 模板的架构设计指引与作者个人介绍。
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== AUTHOR INTRODUCTION ==================== -->
    <section class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-content/10 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
      <div class="card-body p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-8">
        <!-- Top Profile Row -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-6 border-b border-base-content/10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="avatar placeholder">
              <div class="bg-primary text-primary-content rounded-2xl w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">
                <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black">P</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Pony</h2>
                <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm font-medium">Author</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 font-medium">
                Passionate Self-taught Software Developer 👋🏼
              </p>
              <p class="text-xs text-base-content/60">
                Decentralized & Web3 Believer · Quant Trading · Crypto Enthusiast
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 w-full sm:w-auto">
            <a
              href="https://github.com/Pony-Unicorn"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="btn btn-outline btn-sm rounded-xl gap-2 flex-1 sm:flex-initial"
            >
              <Icon name="ion:logo-github" class="h-4 w-4" />
              GitHub
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/Pony-Unicorn/alpinejs-template/issues"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="btn btn-primary btn-sm rounded-xl gap-2 flex-1 sm:flex-initial"
            >
              <Icon name="ion:chatbubble-ellipses-outline" class="h-4 w-4" />
              提交 Issue 交流
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4 Key Intro Cards Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          <!-- Card 1: Decentralized believer -->
          <div class="flex gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-base-200/50 border border-base-content/5">
            <div class="h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-error/10 text-error flex items-center justify-center">
              <Icon name="ion:cube-outline" class="h-5 w-5" />
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-base-content">去中心化信仰与 Crypto</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-base-content/75 leading-relaxed">
                坚定的去中心化信仰者（Decentralized Believer），热爱探索与构建 Crypto
                生态，深信开放互联的去中心化技术力量。
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 2: Current Job / GameFi & Quant -->
          <div class="flex gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-base-200/50 border border-base-content/5">
            <div class="h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center">
              <Icon name="ion:trending-up-outline" class="h-5 w-5" />
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-base-content">当前业务：GameFi 与量化交易研究</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-base-content/75 leading-relaxed">
                目前主要深耕于 GameFi 赛道，专注于量化交易策略（Quant Trading
                Strategy）的建模与研究，探索数字资产市场的运行规律。
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 3: Continuous Learning -->
          <div class="flex gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-base-200/50 border border-base-content/5">
            <div class="h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-success/10 text-success flex items-center justify-center">
              <Icon name="ion:school-outline" class="h-5 w-5" />
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-base-content">持续精进与探索领域</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-base-content/75 leading-relaxed">
                当下正在系统研习算法设计（Algorithm
                Design）及区块链底层系统架构，坚持自学驱动与实践沉淀。
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 4: How to reach -->
          <div class="flex gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-base-200/50 border border-base-content/5">
            <div class="h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-info/10 text-info flex items-center justify-center">
              <Icon name="ion:mail-outline" class="h-5 w-5" />
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-base-content">联系方式与交流</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-base-content/75 leading-relaxed">
                欢迎通过 GitHub 创建 Issue 与我交流。请在 Issue
                中清晰注明你的意图、反馈或合作想法，我会定期查阅并回复。
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== PROJECT GUIDELINES ==================== -->
    <section class="space-y-8">
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">
          <Icon name="ion:layers-outline" class="h-4 w-4" />
          <span>Architecture & Rules</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">项目设计哲学与开发规范</h2>
        <div class="alert alert-neutral border border-base-content/10 shadow-sm rounded-2xl">
          <Icon name="ion:sparkles-outline" class="h-6 w-6 text-primary shrink-0" />
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-sm">核心原则</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-base-content/80 mt-0.5">
              简单的保持简单，复杂的合理拆分。
              <strong>Astro 负责页面渲染与内容架构，Alpine.js 负责动态交互。</strong>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Guidelines Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <!-- 1. Alpine.js 交互规范 -->
        <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-content/10 shadow-sm">
          <div class="card-body space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-lg bg-warning/10 text-warning flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
                01
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">Alpine.js 交互规范</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed list-disc list-inside">
              <li>
                <strong class="text-base-content">轻量简单交互：</strong>
                直接使用 HTML 内联 Alpine 指令（如{' '}
                <code class="bg-base-200 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">x-data</code>,{' '}
                <code class="bg-base-200 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">x-show</code>,{' '}
                <code class="bg-base-200 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">x-on:click</code>
                ），无须额外创建脚本。
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong class="text-base-content">多状态与复杂交互：</strong>
                使用 <code class="bg-base-200 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Alpine.data()</code>{' '}
                抽离业务逻辑至独立 TS 文件，保持模板整洁。
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. 全局状态规范 -->
        <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-content/10 shadow-sm">
          <div class="card-body space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-lg bg-info/10 text-info flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
                02
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">状态作用域规范</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed list-disc list-inside">
              <li>
                <strong class="text-base-content">局部私有状态：</strong>
                仅在当前组件或区块内部起效的状态，优先使用{' '}
                <code class="bg-base-200 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">x-data</code> 管理。
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong class="text-base-content">跨页面/跨组件全局状态：</strong>
                使用 <code class="bg-base-200 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">
                  Alpine.store()
                </code>，统一在{' '}
                <code class="bg-base-200 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">src/scripts/alpine.ts</code>{' '}
                入口中集中注册。
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. 命名规范 -->
        <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-content/10 shadow-sm">
          <div class="card-body space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-lg bg-secondary/10 text-secondary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
                03
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">命名命名约定</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed list-disc list-inside">
              <li>
                <strong class="text-base-content">Astro 组件与布局：</strong>
                遵循{' '}
                <code class="bg-base-200 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-primary font-mono">
                  PascalCase
                </code>
                （大驼峰），例如 <code class="bg-base-200 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Navbar.astro</code>、
                <code class="bg-base-200 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Toaster.astro</code>。
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong class="text-base-content">TypeScript / JavaScript 模块：</strong>
                遵循{' '}
                <code class="bg-base-200 px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-primary font-mono">
                  kebab-case
                </code>
                （短横线连字符），例如{' '}
                <code class="bg-base-200 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">toaster.ts</code>、
                <code class="bg-base-200 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">api.ts</code>。
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. 代码组织与抽象原则 -->
        <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-content/10 shadow-sm">
          <div class="card-body space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-lg bg-success/10 text-success flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
                04
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">代码组织与适度抽象</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed list-disc list-inside">
              <li>
                <strong class="text-base-content">代码归拢：</strong>
                所有 TS 业务代码统一存放于{' '}
                <code class="bg-base-200 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">src/scripts/</code>{' '}
                下，按组件与页面分层。
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong class="text-base-content">拒绝过度设计：</strong>
                简单组件不必机械式创建配套 TS 文件，按实际复杂度合理拆分。
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Directory Structure Preview -->
      <div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-content/10 shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body p-6 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <Icon name="ion:folder-outline" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary" />
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold">标准目录结构一览</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs text-base-content/60 font-mono">src/ tree</span>
          </div>

          <pre class="bg-base-200/80 border border-base-content/5 p-4 rounded-xl text-xs font-mono text-base-content/90 overflow-x-auto leading-relaxed">
src/
├── components/          # Astro 页面组件 (Navbar, Footer, Toaster 等)
├── layouts/             # Astro 布局外层 (Layout.astro)
├── pages/               # 静态与路由页面 (index.astro, about.astro)
├── scripts/             # TypeScript 交互与业务逻辑
│   ├── components/      # 组件配套逻辑 (如 toaster.ts)
│   ├── pages/           # 页面专属复杂交互逻辑
│   ├── lib/             # 通用封装 (api.ts, utils.ts 等)
│   └── alpine.ts        # Alpine 全局插件与 Store 统一注册中心
├── icons/               # 本地自定义 SVG 图标
├── images/              # 图片静态资源
└── app.css              # Tailwind CSS v4 与 daisyUI 配置入口</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
